WEBVTT

00:19:27.871 --> 00:19:33.672
would say giving up some
of this privacy for the students

00:19:33.696 --> 00:19:34.847
is worth it,

00:19:34.871 --> 00:19:38.270
if their scores can go up
and they can do better in school.

00:19:38.294 --> 00:19:44.277
So what we're talking about here
is not purely privacy in isolation,

00:19:44.301 --> 00:19:46.954
but privacy in exchange
for something else.

00:19:47.347 --> 00:19:52.053
And I think in China,
privacy is something people do value,

00:19:52.077 --> 00:19:55.141
but not as much as in the US and Europe.

00:19:55.165 --> 00:19:57.942
And the reason, I think, historically,

00:19:57.966 --> 00:20:02.109
is that China, and actually, most of Asia,